/**
 * Navigation icons for the off canvas rail.
 *
 * These are Font Awesome Free solid marks, taken from the package rather
 * than redrawn, and each key is named for the row it belongs to. The
 * layer names in the Figma component carry the same Font Awesome names,
 * so the two stay identifiable without anyone having to eyeball them.
 *
 * Font Awesome Free is CC BY 4.0 and requires attribution, which belongs
 * on the Site Credits page along with the social marks.
 *
 * Generated from @fortawesome/free-solid-svg-icons. Do not hand edit the
 * path data; change the icon by changing which mark is imported.
 */
